It looks like you wrote `+W+`(async () => ...) or returned a Promise. Instead, write the async function inside your effect and call it immediately:

`+W+`(() => {
 async function fetchData() {
 // You can await here
 const response = await MyAPI.getData(someId);
 // ...
 }
