2. Position the lamp 10 cm from the beaker and allow the plant to acclimatise for two minutes.
3. Count the bubbles released in one minute. Repeat three times and record the mean.
4. Move the lamp to 20 cm, 30 cm, 40 cm and 50 cm, repeating steps 2 and 3 at each distance.`,"Results",`Distance from lamp (cm) Bubbles per minute (mean)
10 42
20 28
30 17
40 11
50 6`,"Conclusion","The data supports the hypothesis. Bubble output fell as the lamp moved away, which matches the inverse-square relationship between distance and light intensity. Above 40 cm the plant appears light-limited, so the reaction rate is controlled by how much light reaches the chloroplasts rather than by the amount of carbon dioxide available."];function Iit(){return tr("div",{className:"fd-docs",role:"document","aria-label":"Google Docs","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:26:5",children:[tr("div",{className:"fd-bar","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:27:7",children:[tr("div",{className:"fd-bar-left","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:28:9",children:[tr("span",{className:"fd-orb","aria-hidden":!0,"data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:29:11"},void 0,!1,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:29,columnNumber:11},this),tr("span",{className:"fd-name","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:30:11",children:"Photosynthesis Lab Report"},void 0,!1,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:30,columnNumber:11},this),tr("span",{className:"fd-star","aria-hidden":!0,"data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:31:11",children:"\u2606"},void 0,!1,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:31,columnNumber:11},this),tr("span",{className:"fd-saved","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:34:11",children:"All changes saved in Drive"},void 0,!1,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:34,columnNumber:11},this)]},void 0,!0,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:28,columnNumber:9},this),tr("div",{className:"fd-bar-right","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:36:9",children:[tr("span",{className:"fd-avatar","aria-hidden":!0,"data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:37:11",children:"A"},void 0,!1,{fileName:nr,lineNumber:37,columnNumber:11},this),tr("span",{className:"fd-share","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/potato/FreezeOverlay.tsx:40:11",children:"Share"},void 0,!1,